- Meds → *Azrael*: added "Even so, she kept choosing the hardest available version of the job." Turns the previous section's cost line into the question this section answers.
- *Azrael* → Drought: added "None of that machinery was there at the start." Signals the jump backward in time instead of letting it happen silently.
- Drought → Same movie: added "That instinct to keep the circle small runs her career too." Carries the gumnut-mafia image straight into the repetition argument.
- Same movie → Closer: "About ten years ago" → "About ten years before Marvel called." Anchors the reverse-chronology jump off the beat just read.

